---
---
<section id="x402" class="section x402">
  <div class="container x402__inner">
    <div class="x402__copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">x402 Agentic Payments</span>
      <h2>Bandwidth that pays itself.</h2>
      <p>
        Sentinel is the first dVPN network with native <strong>x402</strong> support &mdash; the
        HTTP 402 standard for machine-to-machine payments. Agents pay for bandwidth per request,
        per second, or per gigabyte, with no API keys, no accounts, and no human in the loop.
      </p>
      <ul class="x402__bullets">
        <li><span>Pay-as-you-route</span> &mdash; agents stream payment alongside traffic.</li>
        <li><span>No middlemen</span> &mdash; settlement happens directly on chain.</li>
        <li><span>Composable</span> &mdash; works with any wallet, any agent stack.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="x402__cta">
        <a href="https://docs.sentinel.co" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn--primary">Read x402 Spec</a>
        <a href="#build" class="btn">See SDK Example</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="x402__panel">
      <div class="x402__code">
        <div class="x402__code-head">
          <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
          <span class="x402__code-title">agent.ts</span>
        </div>
<pre><code>{`import { SentinelClient } from '@sentinel/sdk';
import { x402 } from '@sentinel/x402';

const client = new SentinelClient({
  payment: x402({ wallet, asset: 'USDC' }),
});

// Agent pays per-request, no API key needed.
const res = await client.fetch('https://target.example/data', {
  route: 'auto',          // pick the cheapest healthy node
  maxCost: '0.0005 USDC', // hard ceiling per request
});`}</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .x402 { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg) 0%, var(--bg-elev) 100%); }
  .x402__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 1fr;
    gap: 56px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .x402__bullets {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 8px 0 28px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .x402__bullets li::before {
    content: '→';
    color: var(--accent-2);
    margin-right: 10px;
  }
  .x402__bullets span { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }
  .x402__cta { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .x402__panel {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 18px;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -30px var(--accent-glow);
  }
  .x402__code-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 4px 6px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #2a3142; }
  .dot:nth-child(1) { background: #ff5f57; }
  .dot:nth-child(2) { background: #febc2e; }
  .dot:nth-child(3) { background: #28c840; }
  .x402__code-title { margin-left: 10px; color: var(--text-mute); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .x402__code pre {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 4px 8px 8px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    color: #c8d1de;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-family: 'SF Mono', ui-monospace, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .x402__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; }
  }
</style>
